<title>UK: London precious metals close down after correction.</title>
<headline>London precious metals close down after correction.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $352.80/$353.30 vs $354.45/$354.95 previously. Corrected from rally's high. May be closer to $350.00 by option expiry.</p>
<p>SILVER - Support at closing $4.97/$4.99 after resistance at $5.05/$5.07. May be setting range.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Ended down $2.50 at $357.25/$358.25.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Closed at $121.75/$122.75, off $2.25.</p>
</text>
